
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Introduction to Information Security</title>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>Introduction to Information Security</h1>
        <p>Learning how to protect information in a digital world.</p>
    </header>

    <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
        <ul>
            <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
            <li><a href="#importance">Importance</a></li>
            <li><a href="#practices">Security Practices</a></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <main>
        <section id="about">
            <h2>About Information Security</h2>
            <p>
                Information security focuses on protecting data,
                computer systems, and networks from unauthorized access,
                damage, and theft.
            </p>

            <img
                src="https://placehold.co/600x300?text=Information+Security"
                alt="Illustration representing information security and digital data protection"
            >
        </section>

        <section id="importance">
            <h2>Why Information Security Matters</h2>
            <article>
                <h3>Protecting Personal Information</h3>
                <p>
                    Security practices help protect passwords,
                    financial records, and other sensitive information.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article>
                <h3>Preventing Cyberattacks</h3>
                <p>
                    Organizations use security tools and procedures
                    to reduce the risk of phishing, malware, and data breaches.
                </p>
            </article>
        </section>

        <section id="practices">
            <h2>Basic Security Practices</h2>
            <p>Everyone can improve their online safety by following these steps:</p>
            <ol>
                <li>Use strong, unique passwords.</li>
                <li>Enable multi-factor authentication.</li>
                <li>Keep software and devices updated.</li>
                <li>Avoid suspicious links and email attachments.</li>
                <li>Back up important files regularly.</li>
            </ol>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>Created as an introduction to information security.</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
